        "explanation": "Audit (Standard), the tier applied without Purview Audit Premium (bundled with E5 or an add-on), retains records for 180 days by default — well short of nine months — so the relevant evidence for this E3-only user has likely already expired. Option a fabricates identical unlimited retention. Option c invents a region-based rule. Option d inverts the actual relationship between license tier and retention length; the extra option restates the same wrong idea with disabled logging, which is also false since Audit (Standard) is on by default."
